SOLUTION 1
    units mmol/kgw
    C 50
    Na 50
    pH 8.3 charge
SOLUTION 2
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    pH 12.5 charge
MIX 1
    1 1.0
    2 1.0
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    100
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file result.sel
    -temperature
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
